              "id": "step-2",
              "title": "Rearrange Solving for Current (I)",
              "label": "Rearrange Solving for Current (I)",
              "rawExpression": "I = V / R",
              "expression": "I = \\frac{V}{R}",
              "latex": "I = \\frac{V}{R}",
              "explanation": "Dividing both sides by Resistance (R) isolates Current (I).",
